    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="22.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 22.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ non mon ne tæce his getihtledan mon from him, ær he hæbbe ryht geworht.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And no one shall send away one of his men, if he has been accused, before the man has complied with the demands of the law.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ nan man ne getæce his getyhtledan men fram him, ær he hæbbe riht geworhte.</ab>
      </div>
